<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left"><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-8259">The amounts reported in this column represent the average of the amounts reported for the Company&#8217;s <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Non-CEO</div> NEOs as a group in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column of the SCT in each applicable year. The names of each of the <div style="white-space:nowrap;display:inline;">Non-CEO</div> NEOs included for purposes of calculating the average amounts in each applicable year are as follows: (i)&#160;for 2025, Messrs. Jenke, Hackworth, Ammari and Chong; (ii)&#160;for each of 2024 and 2023, Messrs. Hackworth, Ammari, Carnifax, and Chong.</ix:nonNumeric> </div></td></tr></table><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-8262">
